CORE
port11.sv
--bound 0
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.i\.data == 123: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The members of the interface under the interface port of the interface
under the module port are connected as well. This used to fail an
invariant, as the symbols for the instantiated interfaces were
equated by the RTL builder.
